    "description": "Mixed Gemstone Crystal & Glass Lot - 25 Pieces\nVarious Patterns and Materials\nMulticolor, Modern Era\nExtensive collection of polished gemstone chips, gravel, and shaped stones suitable for jewelry making, terrariums, or decorative displays. This bulk lot features a diverse range of colors and stone types, primarily consisting of popular amethyst and rose quartz varieties along with complementary accent stones.\nPieces Included:\nAmethyst Chips - 2 large brown paper bags and 4 small clear bags of tumbled purple stone gravel\nRose Quartz Chips - 2 large clear bags of tumbled pale pink stone chips\nRose Quartz Hearts - 4 small bags containing approximately 20 polished heart-shaped stones each\nSouthern Red Agate - 4 small bags of 100g red-orange agate gravel chips\nGreen Gemstone Chips - 4 small bags of 100g green-colored tumbled stone chips\nOpalite/Moonstone Type Chips - 4 small bags of milky white iridescent tumbled chips\nBlack Obsidian Type Chips - 1 small bag of polished black gemstone gravel\nCondition:\nOverall excellent condition for bulk craft material. All stones are factory-polished and tumbled to remove sharp edges. Most bags remain sealed or secured with original retail labeling and price tags. No significant dust or debris observed within the packaging. Total lot weight is approximately 8.5 pounds.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
